                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Rating[/h1]\n4/10\n\n[h1]Intro[/h1]\nMaybe this was fun to play, pre-Amid Evil and Dusk, but we have so many quality old-school shooter choose from now, that something like this simply won't cut the butter.\n\n[h1]Positives[/h1]\n+ Good soundtrack.\n+ Good enemy variety.\n+ Weapons have good impact.\n\n[h1]Negatives[/h1]\n- Poor user interface.\n- Poor feedback as to what's doing damage to you.\n- Unique aesthetics don't mean much when it comes at the expense of player visibility.",
